<title>USA: PCX to open options on Orbotech Ltd May 7.</title>
<headline>PCX to open options on Orbotech Ltd May 7.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange (PCX) said Friday it will list options on Orbotech Ltd stock May 7.</p>
<p>The options will have strike prices at 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2, with initial expiration months of June, July, October and January. Position and exercise limits are set at 4,500 contracts.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to a lead market maker at T&amp;G Capital Management CLP, the PCX said.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750))</p>
